        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_octopus.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 62a56aa2-3963-4c19-b803-74562041c872).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47. Good job in Paris. Our client is still uneasy\rwith the Delgado drug cartel&apos;s reach in the world.  Torres Piombo,\rAKA, &quot;The Bohemian&quot;, has come to Sapienza as an informant for\rthe cartel.  He is meeting with a chemist named Delfio Endrizzi,\rwho has vital information about the Delgado&apos;s cocaine recipe.\rGiulio Baresi is involved with the Italian mafia and plans on\rstealing the intel for himself. Take him out, and make it look like an\raccident... We don&apos;t need the mafia after us.",
